# Normalize line endings: LF in the repo, checked out per-platform for code.
* text=auto eol=lf

# ── Byte-sensitive test fixtures MUST be byte-identical on every OS. ──
# Windows git (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites LF→CRLF on checkout, which silently
# breaks file-upload tests whose backend validator rejects CRLF. Lock fixtures
# as binary so they are never transformed. (A real-world flake that passes in CI, fails on Windows.)
# Add every upload fixture here:
test-data/files/**          -text
*.csv                       -text
*.xlsx                      -text
*.pdf                       -text
*.png                       -text
*.jpg                       -text
